{
  "id": 960,
  "description": "# WELCOME TO SOL INVICTUS\n🔥☀️ **None can defeat those who bear the mark of the Unvanquishable Sun! Join us and become part of the brotherhood who bear the mark!** 🔥☀️\n\n## About us\n🏰 We&#039;re a friendly guild, looking to build a community of players who help each other out and progress together. Get out there, hone your skills, defeat foes, slay bosses and let us all share in our collective victories!\n\n💪 We aim to have fun and take it easy, but make meaningful progress at the same time! \n\n👍 Anyone at any level, if they&#039;re at least combat level 40, can join, as long as they&#039;re active! Participate in raids and challenges as much as you can! \n\n🚨 **3 DAYS OF NO GUILD ACTIVITY = KICK**\n\n## RAIDING EVERY SINGLE DAY!\n‼️ **ONLY DOING RAIDS FOR COMBAT LVL 40+** ‼️\n\n🕑 GUILD RAIDING &amp; TIMEZONE: every day at 18:00 according to EET, UTC+02:00, Daylight saving time (will try to schedule raids a lot of time in advance so that anyone can see them and join)\n\n## FOR GUILD MEMBERS ONLY 👇\n📌 Feel free to join our discord! Message me in-game for a link.\n\n👉 It&#039;s NOT required, it&#039;s purely optional for those who want to get in touch with me or chat with guild members in an easier way. **Make sure you set your name to match your character name, so we know who you are!**",
